{"slug":"gh-n-y","ar":"غ ن ي","total":73,"core":"wealth; sufficiency; availing","forms":[{"ar":"أَغْنَتْ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":28,"gloss":"to avail, benefit","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":5,"p":4,"ar":["حِكْمَةٌۢ","بَـٰلِغَةٌ ۖ","فَمَا","تُغْنِ","ٱلنُّذُرُ"],"en":"Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them]"}},{"ar":"غَنِىّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":24,"gloss":"Rich; free of need","word":"ghani","ex":{"s":29,"a":6,"p":8,"ar":["وَمَن","جَـٰهَدَ","فَإِنَّمَا","يُجَـٰهِدُ","لِنَفْسِهِۦٓ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَغَنِىٌّ","عَنِ","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"And whoever strives only strives for [the benefit of] himself. Indeed, Allah is free from need of the worlds"}},{"ar":"أَغْنَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":15,"gloss":"to enrich; to avail","word":null,"ex":{"s":93,"a":8,"p":3,"ar":["وَوَجَدَكَ","عَآئِلًا","فَأَغْنَىٰ"],"en":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":4,"gloss":"to consider oneself self-sufficient","word":null,"ex":{"s":80,"a":5,"p":3,"ar":["أَمَّا","مَنِ","ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ"],"en":"As for he who thinks himself without need"}},{"ar":"مُّغْنُون","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"availing, able to avert","word":null,"ex":{"s":40,"a":47,"p":15,"ar":["وَإِذْ","يَتَحَآجُّونَ","فِى","ٱلنَّارِ","فَيَقُولُ","ٱلضُّعَفَـٰٓؤُا۟","لِلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَكْبَرُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","لَكُمْ","تَبَعًا","فَهَلْ","أَنتُم","مُّغْنُونَ","عَنَّا","نَصِيبًا","مِّنَ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"en":"And [mention] when they will argue within the Fire, and the weak will say to those who had been arrogant, \"Indeed, we were [only] your followers, so will you relieve us of a share of the Fire"}}],"surahs":[[3,4],[4,4],[9,4],[10,4],[2,3],[11,3],[53,3],[7,2],[12,2],[14,2],[24,2],[31,2],[39,2],[40,2],[45,2],[64,2],[80,2],[92,2],[6,1],[8,1],[15,1],[19,1],[22,1],[26,1],[27,1],[29,1],[35,1],[36,1],[44,1],[46,1],[47,1],[52,1],[54,1],[57,1],[58,1],[59,1],[60,1],[66,1],[69,1],[77,1],[88,1],[93,1],[9